          "code": "SUMMARIZEQUALITYISSUES",
          "id": "1761188278350",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1761188278351_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a Quality report analyst for Product/Items reported quality problems/issues. Given the following data summarize dataset into concise on-to-two sentence executive summary. Focus on the most critical issues and high level risks or recommendations.\nData:\n {{$context.$nodes.GETPROBLEMREPORTFORITEM.$output}}\n\nFollow Instruction: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}} \n"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [
                "ORA_LAYOUT_MESSAGES_LIST"
              ],
              "enableActions": true,
              "enableCommunications": false
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "name": "IntialAnalysisDisplay"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "INTIALANALYSISDISPLAY",
          "id": "1761188423335",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1761188423336_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a Quality report analyst for Product/Items reported quality problems/issues. Given the following data on problem reports(PRs), summarize the key issues, risk and recommendations and categorize them by priority or impact. Include responsible stakeholders and suggested timelines where possible.\n\nFollow the instruction as is\n {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nData:\n {{$context.$nodes.GETPROBLEMREPORTFORITEM.$output}}\n\n**Display a title in 8 words providing insight of Product readiness Quality related issues based on data. Here is an example : \"Key Quality Issues Jeopardize Product Production Readiness Timelines\"\n**Always include a concise text summary (1-2 sentences) that highlights the key insights, patterns, or takeaways from the visualization. Place this summary immediately before the information display.\n\nFORMAT INSTRUCTIONS\n\nFor each item issue in list:\n\n# TITLE\n<ChangeNotice>-[Short description of the problem]>\n\n# SUBTITLE\nOne short sentence reason any risks if issues are not resolved.\n\n#SUMMARY\nMust be one sentence and max 50 words. Only include issue details & Impact with critical data points. DO NOT include Actions/Recommendations.\n\n# BADGE TEXT (Severity)\nAssign a single severity badge Strictly based on \"Priority\".\n- CRITICAL \n- HIGH\n- MEDIUM\n- LOW\n\n#PRIORITY\nBased on <ChangePriorityValue>. Treat ChangePriorityValue \"High\" value as CRITICAL  and \"Medium\"/\"Moderate\" as HIGH.\n\n# TIMESTAMP\nDO NOT Populate this.\n\n#ACTION INSIGHTS\n\nDo not generate any Action Insights.\n\n\n#RESPONSE DIRECTIVE\nMust ignore all lines starting with '#' used in prompt during response."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [],
              "enableActions": false,
              "enableCommunications": true
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "name": "FillCRParamsForCommunication"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "FILLCRPARAMSFORCOMMUNICATION",
          "id": "1761761493034",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1761761493036_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Fill in the parameter `Quality Report`  in {{$context.$app.$OraCommParamsToFill}} \nFollow Instruction: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}} \n\nBased on  given data summarize the issue, its impact, and the action required to resolve the issue. Structure your response as follows:\n\nIssue Summary:\nBriefly describe the main issue in bullet points.\nImpact:\nList the effects or consequences of the issue in bullet points.\nAction Required:\nClearly outline the specific actions needed to resolve the issue in bullet points (e.g., send missing document over email).\nAll details must be presented in bullet point format within their respective sections.\n\nData :  {{$context.$nodes.GETPROBLEMREPORTFORITEM.$output}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "businessObjectCode": "ORA_SCM_PRODUCTMAN_GETPRODUCTCHANGELINES",
