              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Respond back with:\n\ntitle : Processing Failure\ndescription : Your request could not be completed due to an unexpected error on node {{$context.$error.$nodeName}}. Please try again. If the issue persists, contact support and provide reference ID: {{$context.$workflow.$traceId}}.\nbadgeText : ERROR\nvariant: error\n\nDo not Generate any Actions or extra information."
